Package: rustmail
Version: @VERSION@
Section: mail
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Rustmail <rustmail@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal, gnome-keyring, gnupg, pinentry-gnome3 | pinentry-qt
Homepage: https://rustmail.org
Description: Native Slint mail client
 Rustmail is a native desktop mail client built with Rust and Slint.
